---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { publicEndpoint, withBase } from '../lib/urls';
const endpoint=publicEndpoint(import.meta.env.PUBLIC_CONTACT_ENDPOINT);
---
<BaseLayout title="Start a project brief — Quiet Compass" description="Turn a design or web challenge into a focused project brief. Clear validation, honest delivery status, and a local draft you control." route="E05"><section><div class="shell contact-grid"><div><span class="route">Contact / Start with the question</span><h1>What needs<br/>to <em>change?</em></h1><p class="lead">Describe the people, the problem, and the outcome you are working toward. A useful brief does not need to be a perfect brief.</p><div class="notice" id="delivery-status">{endpoint?'Online inquiries are enabled. Submission sends the details you enter to the configured inquiry service.':'Online delivery is not enabled on this deployment. You can prepare, copy, or save a project brief on your device. Nothing will be sent.'}</div><div class="form-info"><h2 style="font-size:1.6rem">A helpful starting point</h2><p>Who is the experience for? What gets in their way? What would a better outcome look like? Include a timeframe when it matters.</p><p>Please do not include passwords, payment details, or sensitive personal information.</p><a class="text-link" href={withBase('privacy/')}>How your information is handled →</a></div></div>
<form id="contact-form" class="panel" data-endpoint={endpoint} aria-describedby="delivery-status"><div id="form-errors" class="error-summary" role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden></div><div class="form-row"><label for="name">Name <span class="muted">(required to send)</span></label><input id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="120" aria-describedby="name-error"/><span id="name-error" class="field-error"></span></div><div class="form-row"><label for="email">Email <span class="muted">(required to send)</span></label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="180" aria-describedby="email-error"/><span id="email-error" class="field-error"></span></div><div class="form-row"><label for="project">What kind of work?</label><select id="project" name="project"><option value="">Choose a direction</option><option>Strategy / systems</option><option>Identity / web</option><option>Research / product</option><option>Something else</option></select></div><div class="form-row"><label for="timing">Timing <span class="muted">(optional)</span></label><input id="timing" name="timing" maxlength="120" placeholder="For example, exploring options this quarter"/></div><div class="form-row"><label for="message">What are you trying to change?</label><textarea id="message" name="message" required minlength="20" maxlength="4000" aria-describedby="message-help message-error"></textarea><small id="message-help">20–4,000 characters. Your text stays here if sending fails.</small><span id="message-error" class="field-error"></span></div><div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label>Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></label></div><div class="form-actions" data-enhancement hidden><button class="btn primary" type="submit" data-send hidden>Send project note →</button><button class="btn" type="button" data-prepare>Prepare a local draft</button></div><p id="form-status" class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div data-draft-box hidden><label for="draft-preview">Your local draft</label><textarea id="draft-preview" class="draft-preview" data-draft-preview readonly rows="10"></textarea><div class="actions"><button class="btn" type="button" data-copy>Copy draft</button><button class="btn" type="button" data-download>Save text file</button></div></div><p class="privacy-copy">Drafts are not saved to browser storage or included in analytics. Copying or saving creates a copy you control.</p><noscript><p class="notice">Sending and draft tools need JavaScript. Nothing is submitted automatically; you can still write and manually copy a brief from these fields.</p></noscript></form>
</div></section></BaseLayout>
